{"results":[{"url":"https://www.nobrokerage.com/project/details/lodha-malabar-walkeshwar-malabar-hill-mumbai-689041","title":"Lodha Malabar, Malabar hill, Mumbai | NoBrokerage.com","raw_content":"![Loading...](/Loader.webp)\n\n* [![Home](/icons/home_quick_link.svg)Home](/)\n* [![Search](/icons/search_quick_link.svg)Search](/search)\n* [![Property](/icons/Add_quick_link.svg)Property](/form/postproperty)\n* [![Profile](/icons/profile_quick_link.svg)Profile](/dashboard)\n\n![Lodha Malabar banner](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/1765372822918-45685fd1412a62fe.jpg)\n\n![Developer Logo 1](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/project/builder-logos/lodha-malabar/builderlogos-lodha-logo-png-0763d9.png)\n\nPalaces by the sea\n\n![Project Icon](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/1765372822917-a73460d34ece82cd.png)\n\n## 4 & 5 BHK Homes\n\nStarting from₹ 65.05 Cr\n\nMalabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n![Lodha Malabar mobile banner](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/1765372822916-c87644182ca1d883.jpg)\n\n![Developer Logo 1](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/project/builder-logos/lodha-malabar/builderlogos-lodha-logo-png-0763d9.png)\n\nPalaces by the sea\n\n![Project details background](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/1765372822915-5bd0286e4a60a29d.jpg)\n\n![Project Icon](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/1765372822917-a73460d34ece82cd.png)\n\nPresenting\n\n## 4 & 5 BHK Homes\n\nStarting from₹ 65.05 Cr\n\nMalabar Hill, Mumbai\n\nLast Updated : 04 Sept, 2026\n\nLodha Malabar\n\nBROKERAGE FREE\n\n[By Lodha Developers Limited](/builder/lodha \"Open Lodha Developers Limited page\")\n\nMalabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n₹ 65.05 – 112.88 Cr+ Charges\n\nEMI starts at ₹ 56.45 Lac / M\n\nUnder Construction\n\nCompletion In 28 Jun 2027 Onwards\n\nLodha Malabar offers exclusive \"Palaces by the sea\" on Walkeshwar Road, an elite South Mumbai location. The project uniquely borders the Arabian Sea and the Hanging Gardens. Residents benefit from Club Saint Amand, a private members' club, and a life orchestrated by the luxury hospitality experts, Saint Amand. It offers large format 4 & 5 BHK, Duplex, and Penthouse options. The MahaRERA registration number is P51900034949.\n\n## ProjectDetails\n\n![Project Type](/projectOverview/icons/project-type.svg)\n\n#### Project Type\n\nResidential\n\n![Status](/projectOverview/icons/status.svg)\n\n#### Status\n\nUnder Construction\n\n![Project Area](/projectOverview/icons/project-area.svg)\n\n#### Project Area\n\n4390.96 SQM\n\n![Towers](/projectOverview/icons/tower.svg)\n\n#### Towers\n\n1\n\n![Configurations](/projectOverview/icons/configuration.svg)\n\n#### Configurations\n\n4 & 5 BHK Apartments\n\n![Total Floors](/projectOverview/icons/total-units.svg)\n\n#### Total Floors\n\n36\n\n![Amenities](/projectOverview/icons/amenities.svg)\n\n#### Amenities\n\n33 Amenities\n\n![Parking](/projectOverview/icons/parking.svg)\n\n#### Parking\n\nAvailable\n\n![Locality](/projectOverview/icons/locality.svg)\n\n#### Locality\n\nMalabar Hill\n\n![Pin code](/projectOverview/icons/pincode.svg)\n\n#### Pin Code\n\n400006\n\n![Landmark](/projectOverview/icons/landmark.svg)\n\n#### Landmark\n\nMalabar Hill\n\n![Address](/projectOverview/icons/address.svg)\n\n#### Address\n\nLodha Malabar, Krishanaraj Society, Sea Face, Walkeshwar, Malabar Hill, Mumbai, Maharashtra\n\n## Configurations\n\n4 BHK3,826 - 4036.79 sq.ft\n\n₹ 65.05 – 68.63 Crore\n\n5 BHK6,271 - 6640.25 sq.ft\n\n₹ 106.61 – 112.88 Crore\n\n![background pattern](/icons/BgPattern.svg)\n\nMumbai\n\n## Want to Schedule a Site Visit?\n\nExplore the property in person at your convenience.\n\n![schedule illustration](/icons/Illustration.svg)\n\n## FloorPlans\n\n4 BHK₹ 65.05 Cr\n\n3826 sq.ftCarpet Area\n\n![4 BHK floor plan](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/floor-plans/4bhk.jpeg)\n\nPossession  \nin Aug 2028\n\n### 4 BHK\n\n₹ 65.05 Cr\n\n3826sq.ft\n\nCarpet Area\n\n![₹ 65.05 Cr](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/floor-plans/4bhk.jpeg)\n\nPossession  \nin Aug 2028\n\n4 BHK₹ 68.63 Cr\n\n4036.79 sq.ftCarpet Area\n\n![4 BHK floor plan](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/floor-plans/4bhk.jpeg)\n\nPossession  \nin Aug 2028\n\n### 4 BHK\n\n₹ 68.63 Cr\n\n4036.79sq.ft\n\nCarpet Area\n\n![₹ 68.63 Cr](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/floor-plans/4bhk.jpeg)\n\nPossession  \nin Aug 2028\n\n## AboutProject\n\nLodha Malabar is a collection of exclusive \"Palaces by the sea\" located in South Mumbai's finest location, on the iconic Walkeshwar Road. The project commands an unmatched address, positioned directly opposite the Governor's estate and touching both the Arabian Sea and the historic Hanging Gardens. This prime positioning places the world literally at the residents' feet. A central feature of the development is Club Saint Amand, a private member's club meticulously conceived around active, social, and leisure lifestyles of its privileged residents. The living experience is orchestrated for seamless comfort and luxury, managed by the discreet and expert touch of the luxury hospitality service, Saint Amand. This service ensures that residents receive world-class attention and a perfectly choreographed life. Lodha Malabar offers Duplex/Pent House/4 & 5 BHK residences. The project is officially registered via the MahaRERA registration number P51900034949.\n\n## Amenities\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/06/18/IMAGE/fire-safety-system-copy-332581.png)\n\nFire Safety System\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/06/30/IMAGE/security-guardspng1-f1b764.png)\n\nSecurity\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/06/18/IMAGE/club-house-a73a39.png)\n\nClubhouse\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/security-guards.svg)\n\nSecurity Guards\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/24-7-water-supply.svg)\n\n24 7 Water Supply\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/24x7-security.svg)\n\n24x7 Security\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/cctv-surveillance.svg)\n\nCctv Surveillance\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/06/18/IMAGE/dg-backup-fe3944.png)\n\nDg Backup\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/lounge-area.svg)\n\nLounge Area\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/deck.svg)\n\nDeck\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/06/18/IMAGE/cab-pickup-and-drop-off-point-3abc78.png)\n\nCab Pickup And Dropoff Point\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/balcony.svg)\n\nBalcony\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/designer-bathroom-tiles.svg)\n\nDesigner Bathroom Tiles\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/glass-partitions-in-bathrooms.svg)\n\nGlass Partitions In Bathrooms\n\n## ProjectGallery\n\n## Brochure\n\n![Brochure Page 1](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/brochures/cmid2hdbv00hasa6x3c2vhj6a/v1/page_1_full.webp)\n\n1of2\n\n## AboutLocation\n\nMalabar Hill is one of Mumbai’s most prestigious and luxurious residential areas, known for sea-view living and exclusive neighbourhood standards. It features high-end apartments, iconic mansions, and secure, private surroundings. With limited inventory and elite demand, property values here continually rise over time. The locality blends tranquillity with proximity to major South Mumbai business areas, making it a prized lifestyle and investment destination.\n\n## Maps\n\nInitializing Map...\n\n![Verified](/icons/green-check.svg)RERA Verified Project\n\n### What is RERA ?\n\nRERA (Real Estate Regulatory Authority) is a government regulatory body established under the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 in India.\n\nIts primary purpose is to regulate the real estate sector, increase transparency, and protect home buyers from fraud, project delays, and unfair practices.\n\n![RERA Approved](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/rera.png)\n\n![RERA QR Code](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/1765372822917-b56438044a26f42e.jpg)\n\nRERA ID\n\nP51900034949\n\n## AboutDeveloper\n\n[![Lodha](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/05/14/IMAGE/lodha-logo-jpg-a3a8a1.jpg)](/builder/lodha \"Lodha\")\n\nLodha![Check](/icons/green-check.svg)\n\nYears of Experience –46 years\n\nLodha Group, operating under Macrotech Developers, is unequivocally one of India's foremost and largest real estate companies, established with a vision for creating world-class residential and commercial landmarks since 1980. Their developer features include a significant emphasis on scale and timely delivery, having successfully completed millions of square feet of development across Mumbai, Pune, and other metropolitan areas. The company's hallmark is its commitment to high-quality construction and an uncompromised customer-centric approach, which has cemented their reputation for building highly desirable properties. Being listed on the BSE and NSE, the group adheres to stringent corporate governance and financial transparency. Lodha specializes in creating large-scale estates that offer holistic living experiences, integrating advanced security, modern infrastructure, and exclusive lifestyle amenities.\n\n80ProjectsCompleted\n\n30OngoingProjects\n\n4In CityProjects\n\n## Disclaimer\n\nNoBrokerage.com is a real estate advertising and information platform. We are not a real estate broker, agent, or channel partner, and we do not facilitate or participate in any property transactions.\n\nThe data displayed on this website is based on inputs from developers, owners, or public sources, and is provided for informational purposes only. While we aim for accuracy, we do not verify the data and make no guarantees regarding its completeness or correctness.\n\nNo information on this website constitutes legal, financial, or investment advice, nor should it be treated as an invitation to purchase or acquire any property. Project listings do not imply RERA registration or regulatory compliance. Users are advised to verify all information independently and consult the relevant RERA authority. All third-party names, images, logos, and trademarks belong to their respective owners.\n\nFor feedback or concerns, email: [support@nobrokerage.com](mailto:support@nobrokerage.com)\n\nLoading reviews...\n\n# Frequently Asked\n\nQuestions\n\nGet answers to the most common questions about Lodha Malabar in West Pune\n\nLodha Malabar is developed by Lodha Developers Limited, a reputed real estate developer in the region.\n\nLodha Malabar is conveniently located near major transport hubs, ensuring seamless connectivity for daily travel.\n\nYou can view the exact map location of Lodha Malabar at available coordinates for better navigation and site visit planning.\n\nThe expected possession date of Lodha Malabar is expected by Jun 2027, as per the RERA filing.\n\nLodha Malabar falls under the STANDALONE housing segment, making it an ideal choice for homebuyers and investors.\n\nThe RERA registration number(s) for Lodha Malabar are P51900034949. You can verify these details on the official state RERA portal.\n\nThe total plot area of Lodha Malabar is 4390.96 SQM, thoughtfully planned for maximum green and recreational spaces.\n\nKey nearby highlights from Lodha Malabar include Aparna Bhuta, Gopi Birla Memorial School, Birla Open Minds International School Walkeshwar and more within easy reach for daily needs.\n\nLodha Malabar offers 5 BHK, 4 BHK apartments, each designed for modern comfortable living.\n\nYes, Lodha Malabar offers dedicated parking for residents, ensuring convenience and security for personal vehicles.\n\nLodha Malabar consists of 1 towers with 36 floors each, offering a premium vertical living experience.\n\nYes, Lodha Malabar is being developed by the developer, a RERA-registered entity ensuring legal and timely construction.\n\nThe carpet area of apartments in Lodha Malabar ranges from 3826 sq.ft sq.ft for 4 BHK to 6640.25 sq.ft sq.ft for 5 BHK, depending on the configuration.\n\nLodha Malabar is currently Under Construction in the area, the city. The project is progressing as per RERA timelines.\n\nThe pricing for units in Lodha Malabar starts from ₹65.05 Cr - ₹112.88 Cr.\n\nLodha Malabar comprises multiple residential units designed to cater to different family sizes and preferences.\n\nFlats in Lodha Malabar include multiple bathrooms and multiple spacious balconies, providing well-planned space for privacy and leisure.\n\nLodha Malabar offers a wide range of amenities including Fire Safety System, Security, Clubhouse, Security Guards, 24 7 Water Supply, 24x7 Security, Cctv Surveillance, Dg Backup, Lounge Area, Deck, Cab Pickup And Dropoff Point, Balcony, Designer Bathroom Tiles, Glass Partitions In Bathrooms, Maid Helper Room, Cab Pickup Point, Basic Amenities, Fire Alarm, Fire Rated Doors, Security Cabin, Seating Area, Vitrified Tile Flooring, 24/7 Electricity Backup, Smart Lighting, Fire Fighting System, Car Parking, Lift, Sit Out Area, Service Lift , Double Height Living Room, Branded Fittings & Fixtures, False Ceiling With Led Lighting, Anti Skid Flooring In Bathrooms.\n\nThe price of apartments in this project starts at ₹65.05 Cr per sq.ft, offering great value in the real estate market.\n\nLodha Malabar is located at\n\nLodha Malabar offers Fire Safety System, Security, Clubhouse, Security Guards, 24 7 Water Supply, 24x7 Security, Cctv Surveillance, Dg Backup, Lounge Area, Deck, Cab Pickup And Dropoff Point, Balcony, Designer Bathroom Tiles, Glass Partitions In Bathrooms, Maid Helper Room, Cab Pickup Point, Basic Amenities, Fire Alarm, Fire Rated Doors, Security Cabin, Seating Area, Vitrified Tile Flooring, 24/7 Electricity Backup, Smart Lighting, Fire Fighting System, Car Parking, Lift, Sit Out Area, Service Lift , Double Height Living Room, Branded Fittings & Fixtures, False Ceiling With Led Lighting, Anti Skid Flooring In Bathrooms for a comfortable lifestyle.\n\nThe carpet area for available units ranges from 3826 sq.ft to 6640.25 sq.ft\n\n![sparkle](/sparkle-icon.svg)\n\nNOBO AI\n\nAI Assistant is Online\n\n# Need Help Finding the Right Property?\n\nChat with our AI assistant for instant answers on West Pune properties—pricing, locations, amenities, and availability. Available 24/7 to guide you at every step.\n\n## Are you Interested inLodha Malabar?\n\nLodha Malabar, Malabar hill, Mumbai | NoBrokerage.com","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6_94B8mAc-I","title":"Runwal Malabar Hill Mumbai | Ultra Luxury Sea View Apartments","raw_content":"# Runwal Malabar Hill Mumbai | Ultra Luxury Sea View Apartments | Price, Floor Plan & Amenities\n## PropertyCloud \n4850 subscribers\n5 likes\n\n### Description\n326 views\nPosted: 7 Mar 2026\nRunwal Malabar Hill Mumbai | Ultra Luxury Sea View Apartments | Price, Floor Plan & Amenities\n\n📥 Download Runwal Malabar Hill E-Brochure: https://tinyurl.com/23fxch3u\n📥 Request Site Visit & Latest Pricing Details: https://tinyurl.com/23fxch3u\n\n🟢 Key Moments in This Video 🟢\n\n⏱ 0:00 Intro\n⏱ 0:36 Project Introduction\n⏱ 1:20 Project Overview\n⏱ 1:48 Location & Connectivity\n⏱ 2:29 Amenities & Lifestyle\n⏱ 2:50 Configurations & Pricing\n⏱ 4:25 Booking Benefits\n⏱ 4:34 Outro\n\n🏙 Runwal Malabar Hill – Project Overview\n\n✨ Runwal Malabar Hill is an ultra-exclusive luxury residential development located in the prestigious neighbourhood of Walkeshwar, Malabar Hill, South Mumbai.\n\nRising on the iconic Beaulieu Estate (Bafna Bungalow) redevelopment site, this landmark project is designed for a privileged few who seek privacy, sea views, and legacy ownership in one of Mumbai’s most elite addresses.\n\n🌟 Key Highlights\n\n• 🏢 Approx. 40-Storey Luxury Tower\n• ✨ Architecture by Broadway Malyan\n• 🚗 2 Basement Levels for visitor parking\n• 🚘 11 Levels of Podium Car Parking\n• 🏛 Grand Double-Height Entrance Lobby\n• 👨‍✈️ Driver Rooms & Service Facilities\n• 🛗 Dedicated Staff Level with Service Elevator\n• 🟤 Armani Bronze Inspired Facade\n• 👑 Ultra-Limited 14 Exclusive Residences\n\n📍 Location & Connectivity – Walkeshwar, Malabar Hill \n\n🔗 Nearby Landmarks & Travel Time\n\n🛕 Walkeshwar Temple – Approx. 3 mins\n🌊 Girgaon Chowpatty – Approx. 7 mins\n🌴 Marine Drive – Approx. 10 mins\n🏢 Nariman Point – Approx. 12 mins\n🏥 Breach Candy Hospital – Approx. 10 mins\n\n✨ This location offers a rare combination of sea proximity, heritage neighbourhood charm and prime South Mumbai connectivity.\n\n🌿 Amenities & Lifestyle\n\nRunwal Malabar Hill offers a refined luxury lifestyle with thoughtfully designed leisure spaces.\n🏖 Premium Lifestyle Amenities\n\n• 🏛 Double-Height Luxury Clubhouse (22 ft height)\n• 🌅 2500 sq.ft Sky Lounge overlooking Arabian Sea\n• 🍸 Exclusive Leisure & Social Spaces\n• 🧑‍💼 Dedicated Staff Level with Service Access\n• 🔐 High-End Security & Privacy Systems\n• 🛋 Elegant Entrance Lobby & Arrival Experience\n\nThis project creates an ultra-exclusive lifestyle ecosystem rather than just apartments.\n\n🏡 Configurations & Indicative Pricing\n\nThis development offers extremely limited inventory.\n\n👑 Total Residences – Only 14\n🏠 Simplex Residences\n📐 Approx 2500 sq.ft Carpet Area\n🏢 Total 6 Residences\n🏡 Duplex Residences\n📐 Approx 5000 sq.ft Carpet Area\n🏢 Total 8 Residences\n🌊 270° Panoramic Arabian Sea Views\n\n🏠 Configurations & Layout\n\n✨ The project offers ultra-luxury limited edition residences designed for spacious living, privacy, and breathtaking sea views.\n\n🏡 Simplex Residences\n\n• 📐 Approx 2500 sq.ft Carpet Area\n• 🏠 Total: 6 Exclusive Residences\n\n🏡 Duplex Residences\n\n• 📐 Approx 5000 sq.ft Carpet Area\n• 🏠 Total: 8 Exclusive Residences\n\n\n💰 Pricing\n• 💵 ₹1.3 Lakh per sq.ft onwards\n\n📅 Possession Timeline\n\n🗓 Internal Target Possession: June 2030\n📜 RERA Possession Timeline: June 2032\n\n📈 2030 Investment Perspective\n\nMalabar Hill is one of Mumbai’s most supply-constrained ultra-luxury markets.\n\nRedevelopment opportunities here are extremely rare, making projects like Runwal Malabar Hill highly valuable.\n\n⭐ Why This Project Stands Out\n• 👑 Only 14 Exclusive Residences\n• 📍 Prestigious Malabar Hill Address\n• 🌊 270° Arabian Sea Views\n• 🏗 Architecture by Broadway Malyan\n• 🏙 Rare South Mumbai Redevelopment Project\n• 💼 Designed for HNIs & UHNIs\n\n📝 Booking & Enquiry Process\nDuring Site Visit:\n\n1️⃣ Detailed Project Presentation\n2️⃣ Residence Pricing & Payment Plan Discussion\n3️⃣ Layout & Sea View Orientation\n4️⃣ Booking & Documentation Assistance\n⚠️ Limited inventory available.\n\n🤝 Need Help Buying Luxury Property?\n\n📲 WhatsApp: https://tinyurl.com/23fxch3u\n🔵 Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=100063863267887\n📸 Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/propertycloud.in\n💼 LinkedIn: https://www.linkedin.com/company/property-cloud-realty-specifier/\n©️ PropertyCloud Realty Specifier Private Limited\n\n\n### Transcript:\nहाय एवरीवन, मैं हूं रोशनी और आप देख रहे हो प्रॉपर्टी क्लाउड। आज हम बात करने वाले हैं साउथ मुंबई के एक अल्ट्रा एक्सक्लूसिव लग्जरी रेजिडेंशियल डेवलपमेंट के बारे में। अगर आप मालाबार हिल या वालकेश्वर जैसे प्रेस्टीजियस एड्रेस में सीबीयू लग्जरी रेजिडेंसेस एक्सप्लोर कर रहे हो। तो ये आज का प्रोजेक्ट आपको डेफिनेटली काफी अच्छा लगेगा। क्योंकि इस वीडियो में हम डिस्कस करेंगे प्रोजेक्ट का ओवरव्यू, लोकेशन एडवांटेजेस, इमिनिटीज, प्राइिंग, बुकिंग ऑफर्स, रेजिडेंशियल कॉन्फ़िगरेशन और सबसे इंपॉर्टेंट पार्ट एक्सक्लूसिविटी और लेगसी वैल्यू। तो चलिए शुरू करते हैं। अगर आप मलाबार हिल जैसे आइकॉनिक एड्रेस पर एक रेयर लग्जरी रेजिडेंसेस सर्च कर रहे हो जहां प्राइवेसी हो, सीवयू हो और लिमिटेड इन्वेंटरी हो तो यह प्रोजेक्ट आपके लिए एक रेयर ओपोरर्चुनिटी हो सकता है। आज हम फीचर कर रहे हैं रणवाल मलाबार हिल वालकेश्वर। यह डेवलपमेंट राइज हो रहा है आइकॉनिक बलो स्टेट साइट पर जो साउथ मुंबई के सबसे कोविटेड रीडवलपमेंट लोकेशन में से एक माना जाता है और प्रोजेक्ट स्पेशली डिजाइन किया गया है सिर्फ प्रिविलेज्ड प्योर रेजिडेंसेस के लिए। अगर हम प्रोजेक्ट के स्केल और आर्किटेक्चर की बात करें तो रणवाल मालाबार हिल एक आइकॉनिक हाई राइज लग्जरी टावर होने वाला है। क्योंकि टावर का आर्किटेक्चर डिजाइन किया गया है इंटरनेशनल आर्किटेक्चर फर्म ब्रॉडवे मालियान के द्वारा। प्रोजेक्ट में होगा अप्रोक्स 40 फ्लोर्स का लग्जरी टावर जो मालाबार हिल स्काई लाइन को रिीडफाइन करेगा। इंफ्रास्ट्रक्चर भी काफी थॉटफुली प्लान है। जैसे टू बेसमेंट लेवल्स फॉर विजिटर पार्किंग, ड्राइवर रूम एंड सर्विस फैसिलिटीज, ग्रैंड डबल हाइट एंटेनेंस लॉबी, 11 लेवल पोडियम कार पार्किंग और सीमलेस लिफ्ट एक्सेस फॉर रेजिडेंस। अब बात करते हैं लोकेशन की। तो ऑनेस्टली साउथ मुंबई रियल स्टेट में लोकेशन ही सबसे बड़ा फैक्टर होता है। रनवाल मालाबार हिल लोकेटेड है डोंगर सी रोड वालकेश्वर मालाबार हिल में। यह एरिया साउथ मुंबई के सबसे प्रेस्टीजियस नेबरहुड्स में से एक है। नियर बाय लैंडमार्क में आपको मिल जाता है बालकेश्वर टेंपल जो बस 3 मिनट के डिस्टेंस पर है। गिरगांव चौपाटी है बस 7 मिनट के डिस्टेंस पर। मरीन ड्राइव आपको मिल जाता है बस 10 मिनट पर। नरिमन पॉइंट मिलता है 12 मिनट्स पर। रिच कैंडी हॉस्पिटल आता है बस 10 मिनट के डिस्टेंस पर। मतलब यहां रेजिडेंस को मिलता है सी प्रॉक्सिमिटी हेरिटेज नेबरहुड और प्राइम कनेक्टिविटी। और अगर लाइफस्टाइल पर्सपेक्टिव से भी देखें तो प्रोजेक्ट काफी प्रीमियम है। रेजिडेंट्स के लिए प्लान है डबल हाइट लग्जरी क्लब हाउस, अरेबियन सी प्लेसिंग स्काई लाउंच, प्रीमियम लेजर इम्यूनिटीज, हाई एंड सिक्योरिटी और प्राइवेसी फीचर्स। मतलब यह प्रोजेक्ट सिर्फ अपार्टमेंट ही नहीं बल्कि एक एक्सक्लूसिव लग्जरी लाइफस्टाइल इकोसिस्टम क्रिएट करता है। कॉन्फ़िगरेशंस की अगर बात करें तो सिंपलेक रेजिडेंसेस स्टार्ट होते हैं अप्रोक्सिममेटली 2500 स्क्वायर फीट के कारपेट एरिया के साथ जो है बस छह रेजिडेंसेस। डुप्लेक रेजिडेंसेस की बात करें तो ये शुरू होते हैं 5000 स्क्वायर फीट से जिसमें है बस आर्ट रेजिडेंसेस और सबसे इंप्रेसिव फीचर 270° का पैनारोमिक अरेबियन सी व्यू जो हर अपार्टमेंट को एक रेयर लग्जरी एक्सपीरियंस बनाते हैं। एक्सपेक्टेड प्राइिंग है अप्रोक्स 1.3 लाख पर स्क्वायर मीटर ऑन व्स। और अगर हम बात करें पजेशन के टाइमलाइन की तो इंटरनल टारगेट पोजीशन एक्सपेक्टेड है बाय जून 2030 और रेरा पोजेशन टाइमलाइन है जून 2032 अगर इन्वेस्टमेंट पॉइंट ऑफ व्यू से देखा जाए तो मलाबार हिल हिस्टोरिकली लिमिटेड सप्लाई मार्केट में रहा है। यहां रीडेडवलपमेंट ओपोरर्चुनिटीज एक्सट्रीमली रेयर होती है और इसी वजह से अल्ट्रा लग्जरी डिमांड स्ट्रांग रहता है। लेकिन इस प्रोजेक्ट में आपको मिलते हैं लिमिटेड इन्वेंटरी, आइकॉनिक लोकेशन, प्रीमियम आर्किटेक्चर और ये तीनों फैक्टर्स मिलाकर लॉन्ग टर्म कैपिटल अप्रिसिएशन पोटेंशियल को स्ट्रांग बनाते हैं। तो फिलहाल रनवाल, मालाबार हिल, मालकेश्वर में लिमिटेड रेजिडेंसेस अवेलेबल है। अगर आप प्राइसिंग, ब्रोशर या प्राइवेट साइट विजिट डिटेल्स चाहते हो तो डिस्क्रिप्शन में दिया गया लिंक आप जरूर चेक करें। मैं हूं रोशनी। आप देख रहे हो प्रॉपर्टी क्लाउड। ऐसी ही और प्रीमियम रियलस्टेट प्रोजेक्ट अपडेट्स के लिए प्रॉपर्टी क्लाउड को सब्सक्राइब करना मत भूलना। प्रॉपर्टी क्लाउड एक प्रॉपटे कंपनी है जो आपको डायरेक्टली कनेक्ट करती है डेवलपर्स के साथ। आपके होमबाइंड प्रोसेस को एकदम इजी करने के लिए। उसी के साथ आपको यहां मिलते हैं कई सारे बेनिफिट्स जैसे स्पॉट डिस्काउंट, जीरो ब्रोकरेज, फ्री पिकअप एंड ड्रॉप सर्विसेस और भी बहुत कुछ।","images":[]},{"url":"https://sitesetu.app/rera/maharashtra/mumbai","title":"Mumbai RERA Project List: 171 Projects - SiteSetu","raw_content":"[Site Setu](/)\n\n[Get Free BOQ](/boq-from-drawing)[Try Live Demo](https://demo.sitesetu.app/)\n\n[Live Demo](https://demo.sitesetu.app/)\n\n\n\n# Mumbai RERA Project List: Registered Projects & Developers\n\nBrowse 171 RERA registered projects in Mumbai, Maharashtra with builder names, registration numbers, and current status.\n\n* 171Total Projects\n* 91Developers\n\n[Open MahaRERA](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/)[Verification guide](/blog/how-to-check-rera-approved-project-india)\n\n## Verify Mumbaiprojects faster\n\nThis page is built for people searching terms like **Mumbai RERA projects** or **RERA approved projects in Mumbai**. Use it to compare projects, but always confirm the same record on the official authority portal.\n\n1. 1Open the project page and note the exact promoter, project phase, and registration number.\n2. 2Search the same details on the official portal and match status, validity, and completion data.\n3. 3Only shortlist projects whose portal record still matches the sales material and timeline you were shown.\n\n[Read the verification guide](/blog/how-to-check-rera-approved-project-india)[RERA compliance guide](/blog/rera-compliance-project-management)\n\nOfficial source\n\n### MahaRERA\n\nOfficial Maharashtra portal for project search, registration details, and complaints.\n\n[Open official portal](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/)\n\nCommon RERA searches\n\n## Other ways buyers search this Mumbaiproject list\n\nBuyers often use city names, state portal names, and shorthand terms when they look for registered projects. Use these shortcuts to confirm you are checking the right city and authority context.\n\nMumbai RERA project listRERA registered projects in MumbaiRERA approved projects in MumbaiMaharashtra RERA project searchMahaRERA project searchMaharashtra RERA project listMumbai MahaRERA RERA projects\n\nLooking beyond Mumbai? Use the national[RERA project search](/rera) to find any registered project in this directory by project name, builder, or RERA registration number.\n\n## Developers in Mumbai\n\nDevelopers with projects listed in this directory\n\n[Godrej Properties](/developer/godrej-properties)[Lodha Group](/developer/lodha-macrotech)[Rustomjee Group\n\n8projects](/developer/rustomjee-group)\n\nShapoorji Pallonji Real Estate (SPRE)\n\n[LODHA DEVELOPERS LIMITED\n\n5projects](/developer/lodha-macrotech)\n\n## Mumbai RERA Project List\n\nShowing 171 of 171 RERA registered projects in Mumbai\n\n[![Godrej Avenue Eleven](/images/project-fallback.svg)\n\n### Godrej Avenue Eleven\n\nby Godrej Properties\n\nMahalaxmi (7 Rasta), MumbaiReal EstateDecember 2028\n\nRERA No.\n\nP51900005216 (Tower A)\n\nRs 11.85 Cr - Rs 33.64 Cr](/rera/maharashtra/mumbai/godrej-avenue-eleven)[![Godrej Bayview](/images/project-fallback.svg)\n\n### Godrej Bayview\n\nby Godrej Properties\n\nVashi Sector 9, Navi MumbaiReal EstateDecember 2027 (Phase 1), Decem...\n\nRERA No.\n\nRs 3.25 Cr - Rs 4.60 Cr+ (starting)](/rera/maharashtra/mumbai/go