rera/maharashtra/mumbai/sobha-inizio-phase-i)[Sunteck City Avenue 1\n\nSunteck Realty Limited](/rera/maharashtra/mumbai/sunteck-city-avenue-1)[Sunteck City Avenue 2\n\nSunteck Realty Limited](/rera/maharashtra/mumbai/sunteck-city-avenue-2)[Sunteck Icon, Kolekalyan, CST Road, Kalina, Santacruz East, Mumbai\n\nSunteck Realty Limited](/rera/maharashtra/mumbai/sunteck-icon-kolekalyan-cst-road-kalina-santacruz-east-mumba)[Sunteck Pinnacle\n\nSunteck Realty Limited](/rera/maharashtra/mumbai/sunteck-pinnacle)[Supreme Ellora\n\nSUPREME REALTORS](/rera/maharashtra/mumbai/supreme-ellora)[Suraj Park View 1\n\nSuraj Estate Developers](/rera/maharashtra/mumbai/suraj-park-view-1)[Tata Serein\n\nTata Housing (Ardent Properties Pvt Ltd)](/rera/maharashtra/mumbai/tata-serein)[The Arcadian\n\nSri Lotus Developers & Realty](/rera/maharashtra/mumbai/the-arcadian-juhu)[The Westpark Phase 1](/rera/maharashtra/mumbai/the-westpark-phase-1)[VIGHNAHARTA APARTMENTS\n\nKULSWAMINI DEVELOPERS](/rera/maharashtra/mumbai/vighnaharta-apartments)[VIGHNAHARTA SRA CHS LTD\n\nPARSN CONSTRUCTION AND DEVELOPERS PRIVATE LIMITED](/rera/maharashtra/mumbai/vighnaharta-sra-chs-ltd)[Wadhwa 723 Avenue\n\nHarshvardhan Constructions](/rera/maharashtra/mumbai/wadhwa-723-avenue)\n\n## Quick questions before you shortlist in Mumbai\n\nHow do I use this Mumbai RERA project list?\n\nUse this page to shortlist projects in Mumbai, compare developer names and registration details, and then open the matching authority record before you treat any project as verified.\n\nWhat is the fastest way to verify a Mumbai project?\n\nSearch the project name or registration number on the official MahaRERA portal, then match the promoter name, phase, location, status, and expected completion details against this directory page.\n\nWhy do some Mumbai projects have similar names?\n\nLarge developers often register multiple phases, towers, or continuation filings with similar names. Always compare the registration number, promoter entity, and phase-specific details instead of relying on the headline project name alone.\n\n## Managing a Construction Project in Mumbai?\n\nSite Setu helps builders, contractors, and site teams manage tasks, inventory, procurement, and expenses from a single mobile app.\n\n[Explore Site Setu](/product)\n\n[Chat on WhatsApp](https://wa.me/919310492831?text=Hi%20Site%20Setu%2C%20I'd%20like%20to%20know%20more%20about%20the%20construction%20management%20app%20and%20a%20free%20pilot.)","images":[]},{"url":"https://runwalmalabar-hill.in","title":"Runwal Malabar Hill | Duplex at Mumbai","raw_content":"* [Floor Plan](#configration_floor_plan)\n* [Price](#configration_floor_plan)\n* [Gallery](#gallery)\n\n![Runwal Malabar Hill  Banner](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/1772109807.jpg)\n\n![Runwal Malabar Hill  Banner](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/1772109816.jpg)\n\nMahaRERA Website\n\n [maharera.maharashtra.gov.in](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/) \n\nProject MahaRERA No.\n\n [![PR1170002502441](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/qr/Runwal-Malabar-Hill-QR-PR1170002502441_-26022026125452.png)](javascript:void(0);)\n\nProject MahaRERA No.\n\n [![A51700026634](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/qr/A51700026634.png)](javascript:void(0);)\n\nProject MahaRERA No. PR1170002502441\n\n[![PR1170002502441](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/qr/Runwal-Malabar-Hill-QR-PR1170002502441_-26022026125452.png)](javascript:void(0);)\n\nProject MahaRERA No. A51700026634\n\n[![A51700026634](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/qr/A51700026634.png)](javascript:void(0);)\n\n![Runwal Malabar Hill  Banner](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/1772109807.jpg)\n\n![Runwal Malabar Hill  Banner](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/1772109816.jpg)\n\nFor Best Offers Fill Your Details\n\n![Runwal Realty Developer](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/1678871226.svg)\n\nRunwal Realty\n\nDeveloper\n\n![Malabar Hills, Mumbai Location](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/1678871255.svg)\n\nMalabar Hills, Mumbai\n\nLocation\n\n# About Runwal Malabar Hill Project\n\n**Runwal Malabar Hill** is a Project by **Runwal Realty** situated in the most premium location of **Mumbai**, Malabar Hill, NEXT TO THE GOVERNOR’S ESTATE offers  **Duplex** Apartment . Also get Floor Plan, Price Sheet, RERA ID, Reviews, Possession Timeline, Construction Status, Location Advantages, Address, Amenities & Specifications. Runwal Realty Runwal Malabar Mumbai is an Exclusive Premium Tower of **G + 34** **Storey**. Runwal Malabar Hill Runwal Realty Mumbai Property Features **Amenities** like Serene Infinity Pool, Sunlit Sundeck, Tranquil Jacuzzi, Ice Lounge, Gymnasium, Private Business Suite, Grand Arrival Lobby, Private Drop‑Off And Three‑Sided, Verdant Landscape, The Jacuzzi. Runwal Malabar Hill  Has **Excellent Connectivity** Wilson College - 4 Mins, DSB International School - 9 Mins, Hill Spring International School - 10 Mins, Jai Hind College - 12 Mins, The Malabar Hill Club - 4 Mins, Breach Candy Club - 8 Mins, The Taj Mahal Palace - 12 Mins, St. Regis - 14 Mins, Wankhede Stadium - 8 Mins, Mahalaxmi Race Course - 10 Mins, Atria Mall - 12 Mins, Walkeshwar Jain Temple - 2 Mins, Babulnath Temple - 4 Mins, ITC - 16 Mins.\n\nMalabar Hill is well-connected to Worli, Nariman Point, Colaba, Bandra, Churchgate.\n\n**Runwal Realty** has many ongoing, upcoming & completed Projects Runwal Anthurium - Mulund, Runwal Mycity - Dombivli East, The Residence -  Nepean Sea Road, Runwal Elegante - Andheri West, The Reserve - Worli, Nirvana By - Parel.\n\n![Runwal Malabar Hill _ Elevation Image](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/image1772109735.jpg)\n\n## Runwal Malabar Hill Overview\n\n![Project Name](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/image1729333292.svg)\n\nProject Name\n\nRunwal Malabar Hill\n\n![Location](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/image1729333246.svg)\n\nLocation\n\nMalabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n![Developer Name](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/image1729333232.svg)\n\nDeveloper Name\n\nRunwal Realty\n\n![TOTAL TOWERS](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/image1678871433.svg)\n\nTOTAL TOWERS\n\n1\n\n![FLOORS](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/image1678871419.svg)\n\nFLOORS\n\nG + 34 Storey\n\n![APARTMENTS](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/image1678871403.svg)\n\nAPARTMENTS\n\nDuplex Apartment\n\n![AREA](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/image1678871390.svg)\n\nAREA\n\n5000 Sqft\n\n![POSSESSION](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/image1678871368.svg)\n\nPOSSESSION\n\nUnder Construction\n\n![RESEDENTIAL](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/image1678871349.svg)\n\nRESEDENTIAL\n\nProperty\n\n## Runwal Malabar Hill Property Specification\n\n|  |\n| --- |\n| Designed by Broadway Malyan |\n| Armani Bronze Facade |\n| Grand double-height lobby |\n| Two basements + dedicated staff level (L1with separate service elevator access) |\n| 11 parking bays (approx. 2500 sq.ft) |\n| Double-height clubhouse (22 ft) |\n| 2500 sq.ft Sky Lounge with amenities overlooking the Arabian Sea |\n\n## Configuration & Price Of Runwal Malabar Hill\n\n| Type | Carpet Area (sq ft) | Price |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n|\n| Duplex Apartment | 5000 Sqft | Call for Price |\n\n## Runwal Malabar Hill Floor Plan\n\n## Runwal Malabar Hill Gallery\n\n### Elevation Images\n\n![Runwal-Malabar-Hill-Banner-2](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/Runwal-Malabar-Hill-Banner-2-26022026125011.jpg)\n\nRunwal-Malabar-Hill-Banner-2\n\n![Runwal-Malabar-Hill-Banner-1](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/Runwal-Malabar-Hill-Banner-1-26022026125024.jpg)\n\nRunwal-Malabar-Hill-Banner-1\n\n![Runwal-Malabar-Hill-Actual-View](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/Runwal-Malabar-Hill-Actual-View-26022026125210.jpg)\n\nRunwal-Malabar-Hill-Actual-View\n\n![Runwal-Malabar-Hill-Actual-View](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/Runwal-Malabar-Hill-Actual View-26022026125223.jpg)\n\nRunwal-Malabar-Hill-Actual-View\n\n![Runwal-Malabar-Hill-About-Us](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/Runwal-Malabar-Hill-About-Us-26022026125256.jpg)\n\nRunwal-Malabar-Hill-About-Us\n\n### Sample Flat Photos\n\n![Runwal-Malabar-Hill-Internal-Gallery-Sovereign-Lounge](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/Runwal-Malabar-Hill-Internal-Gallery-Sovereign-Lounge-26022026124858.jpg)\n\nRunwal-Malabar-Hill-Internal-Gallery-Sovereign-Lounge\n\n![Runwal-Malabar-Hill-Internal-Gallery-Kitchen](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/Runwal-Malabar-Hill-Internal-Gallery-Kitchen-26022026124914.jpg)\n\nRunwal-Malabar-Hill-Internal-Gallery-Kitchen\n\n![Runwal-Malabar-Hill-Internal-Gallery-Washroom](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/Runwal-Malabar-Hill-Internal-Gallery-Washroom-26022026124928.jpg)\n\nRunwal-Malabar-Hill-Internal-Gallery-Washroom\n\n![Runwal-Malabar-Hill-Internal-Gallery-Deck](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/Runwal-Malabar-Hill-Internal-Gallery-Deck-26022026124941.jpg)\n\nRunwal-Malabar-Hill-Internal-Gallery-Deck\n\n![Runwal-Malabar-Hill-Internal-Gallery](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/Runwal-Malabar-Hill-Internal-Gallery-26022026124955.jpg)\n\nRunwal-Malabar-Hill-Internal-Gallery\n\n![Runwal-Malabar-Hill-Amenities-The-Pavilion-Suite](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/Runwal-Malabar-Hill-Amenities-The-Pavilion-Suite-26022026125040.jpg)\n\nRunwal-Malabar-Hill-Amenities-The-Pavilion-Suite\n\n![Runwal-Malabar-Hill-Amenities-The-Gymnasium](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/Runwal-Malabar-Hill-Amenities-The-Gymnasium-26022026125055.jpg)\n\nRunwal-Malabar-Hill-Amenities-The-Gymnasium\n\n![Runwal-Malabar-Hill-Amenities-Swimming-Pool](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/Runwal-Malabar-Hill-Amenities-Swimming-Pool-26022026125110.jpg)\n\nRunwal-Malabar-Hill-Amenities-Swimming-Pool\n\n![Runwal-Malabar-Hill-Amenities-Entrance](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/Runwal-Malabar-Hill-Amenities-Entrance-26022026125126.jpg)\n\nRunwal-Malabar-Hill-Amenities-Entrance\n\n![Runwal-Malabar-Hill-Amenities-Drop-Off-Lobby](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/Runwal-Malabar-Hill-Amenities-Drop-Off-Lobby-26022026125142.jpg)\n\nRunwal-Malabar-Hill-Amenities-Drop-Off-Lobby\n\n![Runwal-Malabar-Hill-Amenities-2-Level-Clubhouse](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/Runwal-Malabar-Hill-Amenities-2-Level-Clubhouse-26022026125156.jpg)\n\nRunwal-Malabar-Hill-Amenities-2-Level-Clubhouse\n\n![Runwal-Malabar-Hill](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/Runwal-Malabar-Hill-26022026125240.jpg)\n\nRunwal-Malabar-Hill\n\n#### External Amenities\n\n* Serene Infinity Pool\n* Sunlit Sundeck\n* Tranquil Jacuzzi\n* Ice Lounge\n* Gymnasium\n* Private Business Suite\n* Grand Arrival Lobby\n* Private Drop‑Off And Three‑Sided\n* Verdant Landscape\n* The Jacuzzi\n\n#### Internal Features\n\n* Marble‑Clad Private Lobbies\n* Granite Staircases\n* Designer Tiles In Lift Lobbies\n* Private Elevator And Private Lobby\n* Flexible Outhouse Space\n* Integrated Within The Residence\n\n## Runwal Malabar Hill Walkthrough Video\n\n![https://www.youtube.com/embed/sTXxEveA_Yw](//i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/sTXxEveA_Yw/maxresdefault.webp)\n\n![https://www.youtube.com/embed/sTXxEveA_Yw](//i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/sTXxEveA_Yw/maxresdefault.webp)\n\n![image](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/Runwal-Developer-favicon_-26022026125357.png)\n\n## Runwal Realty\n\nRunwal Realty is a prominent Indian real estate development company that's been around since 1978. With over 45 years of experience, they've built a reputation for delivering high-quality residential, commercial, and retail projects. The company, founded by Subhash Runwal, is now led by his son Sandeep Runwal, who has expanded their portfolio with luxurious projects like Runwal Malabar and Runwal The Residence. Runwal Realty has completed over 50 projects, serving more than 48,000 families, and is known for its focus on quality, sustainability, and customer satisfaction\n\n### Enquire Now\n\n### Runwal Malabar Hill Construction Status\n\n## Runwal Malabar Hill Location\n\n## Runwal Malabar Hill Sales Gallery / Office Address & Experience Center\n\nRunwal Malabar Hill, Dongarsi Road, Teen Batti, Malabar Hill, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400006.\n\n## Runwal Malabar Hill MahaRera\n\n[![PR1170002502441](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/qr/Runwal-Malabar-Hill-QR-PR1170002502441_-26022026125452.png)](javascript:void(0);) \n\nPR1170002502441\n\nThe website project is registered under  [maharera.maharashtra.gov.in](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/)\n\n## Frequently Asked Question\n\n[What types of homes are available at Runwal Malabar Hill?](#collapse0)\n\nRunwal Malabar Hill offers Duplex Apartment Carpet 5000 Sqft.\n\n[What amenities are provided at Runwal Malabar Hill?](#collapse1)\n\nThe project includes over 25 amenities such as a Serene Infinity Pool, Sunlit Sundeck, Tranquil Jacuzzi, Ice Lounge, Gymnasium, Private Business Suite, Grand Arrival Lobby, Private Drop‑Off And Three‑Sided, Verdant Landscape, The Jacuzzi and more.\n\n[What is the location advantage of Runwal Malabar Hill?](#collapse2)\n\nLocated Nearby Wilson College - 4 Mins, DSB International School - 9 Mins, Hill Spring International School - 10 Mins, Jai Hind College - 12 Mins, The Malabar Hill Club - 4 Mins, Breach Candy Club - 8 Mins, The Taj Mahal Palace - 12 Mins, St. Regis - 14 Mins, Wankhede Stadium - 8 Mins, Mahalaxmi Race Course - 10 Mins, Atria Mall - 12 Mins, Walkeshwar Jain Temple - 2 Mins, Babulnath Temple - 4 Mins, ITC - 16 Mins, the property offers excellent connectivity.\n\n[Is Runwal Malabar Hill, a RERA-registered project?](#collapse3)\n\nYes, Runwal Malabar Hill is an RERA-authorized project with MahaRERA number PR1170002502441.\n\n[![Runwal Malabar Hill ](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/qr/A51700026634.png)](https://maharerait.maharashtra.gov.in/agent/view/40583) \n\n[![Runwal Malabar Hill ](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/qr/A51700026634.png)](https://maharerait.maharashtra.gov.in/agent/view/40583)  The information provided on this website is intended exclusively for informational purposes and should not be construed as an offer of services. This site is managed by a RERA authorized real estate agent namely Digipace Consulting (OPC) Private Limited (Registered Agent bearing RERA No: A51700026634).\n\nThis website is a digital promotional showcase managed by\n\n#### **Digipace Consulting (OPC) Private Limited**,\n\nan independent, MahaRERA-registered real estate agent bearing\n\n#### **MahaRERA Real Estate Agent Registration No. A51700026634**.\n\nThe project showcased herein, **Runwal Malabar Hill**, is a registered real estate project developed by **Runwal Realty**, bearing **MahaRERA Project Registration Number:** PR1170002502441. All project-related particulars, including specifications, configurations, dynamic floor plans, and layout designs, are provided for consumer awareness and initial guidancee.\n\nThe text, representations, layout diagrams, and computer-generated mockups or images used on this portal are artist impressions and are indicative only. The final terms, pricing structure, dynamic stock availability, and specific project timelines are subject to change as per the promoter/developer’s updates or market modifications. In strict alignment with the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 (RERA), all buyers are encouraged to independently verify all verified files, sanctioned building plans, and project progress statuses on the official MahaRERA website at <https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in> under the registered project number before making any booking or financial commitment.\n\nDigipace Consulting (OPC) Private Limited functions purely as an authorized sourcing/facilitating partner and shall not be held liable for any unilateral alterations made by the developer to the underlying layout or project construct.","images":[]},{"url":"https://propertybutler.in/insights/sambhav-primordial-house-malabar-hill-review-2026","title":"Sambhav Primordial House — Malabar Hill Building Review 2026: Price, Verdict and Who It's For | Property Butler","raw_content":"![Property Butler](/logo.png)\n\n3 May 2026 · 8 min read\n\n# Sambhav Primordial House — Malabar Hill Building Review 2026: Price, Verdict and Who It's For\n\nSummary\n\nSambhav Primordial House at Walkeshwar (RERA P51900010963) is priced at Rs 54,209/sqft — 57.7% below Aurum Girnar in the same micro-market. This review covers the project specifics, Walkeshwar micro-market context, developer track record considerations, and who this building actually makes sense for at Rs 5.24-10.40 Cr.\n\n# Sambhav Primordial House — Malabar Hill Building Review 2026: Price, Verdict and Who It’s For\n\nSambhav Primordial House at Walkeshwar, Malabar Hill sits at the intersection of two narratives — the boutique developer play in Mumbai’s most aspirational address, and a per-sqft asking of **₹54,209/sqft** that positions it significantly below the Aurum Girnar benchmark (₹1,28,217/sqft) in the same micro-market. Property Butler tracks one listing from this project in our inventory (RERA: P51900010963, asking ₹5.24–10.40 Cr). This review gives you the full picture — project specifics, location dynamics, Walkeshwar micro-market context, comparable buildings, and an honest assessment of who Sambhav Primordial House makes sense for in 2026.\n\nSambhav Primordial House — Property Butler Data Snapshot\n\nP51900010963\n\nRERA registration\n\n₹54,209/sqft\n\nAverage asking PSF\n\n₹5.24–10.40 Cr\n\nListing price range\n\nUnder Construction\n\nProject status\n\n## Location — Why Walkeshwar Is Not Just “Malabar Hill”\n\nWalkeshwar is the old-money core of Malabar Hill — the area between the ancient Walkeshwar Temple, Banganga Tank, and the cliff edge overlooking Back Bay. Unlike the Pedder Road end of Malabar Hill (which is busier and more accessible), Walkeshwar has a distinct quality: it is quieter, more secluded, and retains a heritage residential character that even Malabar Hill’s own broader canopy cannot fully claim. The streets here are narrow, the buildings are set back from the road, and the density is low. Sambhav Primordial House sits in this pocket, commanding the Walkeshwar address at a PSF that reflects boutique developer scale rather than Lodha or Birla pricing power.\n\nThe critical view consideration: Sambhav Primordial House’s upper floors have partial or full views of the Banganga Tank complex and the cliff-facing Back Bay. These are among Mumbai’s most unusual residential views — a heritage water tank and the colonial-era marine landscape — and they command a premium that pure sea-facing PSF comparisons (which favour towers at Worli Sea Face or Cuffe Parade) do not fully capture.\n\n## Project Details and Configuration\n\nSambhav Group is a smaller developer operating in Mumbai’s boutique luxury segment. The Primordial House project is a low-unit-count building — Property Butler tracks one unit in our active inventory — which is consistent with the Walkeshwar development pattern: boutique buildings of 12–30 units on individual plots, not large-tower projects. This creates both a premium (exclusivity, no shared amenity costs diluted across hundreds of units) and a risk (smaller developer track record, less institutional backing, longer construction periods).\n\nThe project’s RERA registration P51900010963 is verifiable on the Maharashtra RERA portal (maharera.mahaonline.gov.in). Property Butler advises all buyers to verify: (1) RERA-committed possession date; (2) current construction stage versus RERA milestone schedule; (3) whether the developer has drawn any funds from the RERA escrow account beyond permitted stages. Small boutique developers on Malabar Hill have a mixed track record on construction pace — a completed, OC-received unit is worth a significant premium over an under-construction unit from the same developer.\n\n## The 57.7% PSF Discount vs Aurum Girnar — What It Means\n\nThe starkest data point in Property Butler’s Walkeshwar comparison: Sambhav Primordial House at ₹54,209/sqft sits 57.7% below Aurum Girnar at ₹1,28,217/sqft. Both are under-construction boutique buildings in the Malabar Hill / Walkeshwar micro-market. What explains the gap?\n\n| Parameter | Sambhav Primordial House | Aurum Girnar | Satellite Sesen |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Developer | Sambhav Group | Aurum Real Estate | Satellite Developers |\n| RERA | P51900010963 | P51900080926 | Verify on portal |\n| Avg asking PSF | ₹54,209 | ₹1,28,217 | ₹55,000–75,000 (est.) |\n| Total asking range | ₹5.24–10.40 Cr | ₹29.49 Cr+ | ₹10–25 Cr (est.) |\n| Configuration | As per RERA filing | 3–4 BHK, 1,055–2,228 sqft carpet | Boutique, small count |\n| Property Butler Trust Score | 60/100 (B) | 55/100 (C+) | Verify |\n\n## Who Sambhav Primordial House Makes Sense For\n\nThis is the most important question, and it depends entirely on what you are optimising for. Sambhav Primordial House makes sense for a buyer who: (1) wants a Malabar Hill / Walkeshwar address at under ₹60,000/sqft, which is otherwise unavailable in new construction here; (2) values the heritage and cultural significance of the Banganga-Walkeshwar Temple micro-pocket over pure sea-facing premium; (3) has appetite for boutique developer risk and is able to closely monitor RERA milestones; (4) is in the ₹5–12 Cr budget range and wants a Malabar Hill new-launch rather than a resale in an older society building.\n\nIt does NOT make sense for buyers who: (1) need RERA-guaranteed possession certainty on a specific date; (2) require institutional developer brand for external validation (family approval, NRI family members who associate Malabar Hill with established developer names only); (3) are comparing it to RTM resale options at similar PSF — at ₹54,000/sqft, there are Malabar Hill resale options in society buildings that deliver immediate possession, no GST, and no construction timeline risk.\n\n## Due Diligence Checklist for Sambhav Primordial House Buyers\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions\n\nThe committed possession date is available on the RERA portal under registration P51900010963. Property Butler advises verifying this directly on maharera.mahaonline.gov.in rather than relying on marketing materials. Small developers on Malabar Hill have historically taken 12–24 months beyond the RERA date to complete projects — factor this into your decision if you need possession by a specific date.\n\nThe resale option at ₹55,000/sqft offers immediate possession, no GST (if RTM), and no construction timeline risk — but requires thorough due diligence on OC, structural condition, and society health, which takes 60–90 days. Sambhav Primordial House offers the credibility of RERA registration and new construction quality — but adds 5% GST, construction timeline uncertainty, and boutique developer execution risk. For buyers who can manage resale due diligence, a well-selected resale at similar PSF is typically the better risk-adjusted choice. For buyers who lack the capacity or contacts for resale due diligence, a RERA-registered new launch removes that complexity at a cost.\n\nYes. NRIs and OCIs can buy under-construction properties in India, subject to FEMA payment routing rules (NRE/NRO/FCNR accounts only, as described in the NRI buyer guide). The 5% GST on under-construction applies to NRI buyers identically to resident buyers. The RERA consumer protection — interest at SBI MCLR + 2% on delayed possession — protects NRI buyers just as it protects residents. Property Butler’s NRI advisory team has managed FEMA compliance for Walkeshwar and Malabar Hill under-construction purchases previously.\n\nLodha Altamount on Altamount Road / Pedder Road is a different tier entirely — Lodha brand, much larger project, PSF significantly higher than Sambhav’s ₹54,209. Altamount Road targets the ₹25–100 Cr buyer; Sambhav Primordial House at ₹5–10 Cr targets a materially different budget segment. The address comparison is also different: Altamount Road has the “Antilia street” cachet and is more accessible by car; Walkeshwar has heritage resonance and temple proximity. Both are within 1.5 km of each other but serve distinct buyer profiles and price points.\n\nInterested in Sambhav Primordial House or Other Malabar Hill Options?\n\nProperty Butler can arrange a site visit to Sambhav Primordial House and provide a comparative analysis against Aurum Girnar, Satellite Sesen, and the best resale options at similar PSF in the Walkeshwar micro-market.\n\nRelated Reading\n\nProperty Butler · Reply within 30 min\n\n### Buying in Malabar Hill? Talk to a Property Butler advisor\n\nWe track every active listing in Malabar Hill. Drop your number — we reply within 30 min on WhatsApp.\n\n![Prithvi Shah](/api/team-photo/prithvi-shah)\n\n100+ Mumbai transactions in 2025 · MahaRERA registered · No spam\n\nRead Next\n\n### Lodha Malabar Malabar Hill — Complete Review 2026: Prices, Configurations, Sea vs Garden View & Who Should Buy\n\nLodha Malabar on Ridge Road is one of the most significant luxury projects on Malabar Hill — 3 BHK from Rs 18 Cr to penthouse above Rs 100 Cr. Sea-facing and garden-facing units. OC received and fully occupied. Property Butler's standalone 2026 review.\n\n19 May 2026\n\n### Kalpataru Azuro Malabar Hill — Complete Buyer Guide 2026: Pricing, Configurations & How It Compares to Seamont and Runwal Malabar\n\nKalpataru Azuro on Malabar Hill asks Rs 1.25–1.34 lakh PSF for 3–4 BHK under construction (possession 2027–2028). It is Kalpataru's third Malabar Hill project. Property Butler's complete buyer guide with pricing, comparison to alternatives, and due diligence checklist.\n\n19 May 2026\n\n### Aurum Girnar Walkeshwar Review 2026 — Six Sky Residences, ₹29 Crore and the Malabar Hill Ultra-Niche\n\nJust 6 Sky Residences on floors 17–33 at Walkeshwar, starting ₹29.49 Cr (~₹1.28L/sqft, +35% above Malabar Hill average). Property Butler full review: price anatomy, view geometry, Aurum Seven comparison, due-diligence checklist, and buyer-profile verdict.\n\n11 May 2026\n\nThe Mumbai Brief\n\n### Read the next story before anyone else\n\nProperty Butler publishes one deeply reported story about Mumbai real estate every Monday morning. History, market data, builder profiles, redevelopment battles, the things you won't read on listings sites. Free. No spam. Unsubscribe anytime.\n\nBy subscribing you agree to receive our weekly Mumbai property brief. We never share your email.\n\nNeed help with a specific Mumbai property?\n\n![Property Butler](/logo.png)\n\nMumbai's premium real estate advisory. Intelligent property matching for discerning buyers and investors.\n\n#### Quick Links\n\n#### Popular Areas\n\n#### Popular Searches\n\n#### Featured Projects\n\n#### Get In Touch\n\nProperty Butler is a RERA-registered real estate brokerage in Mumbai, serving buyers and investors across Worli, Bandra, Lower Parel, Parel, BKC, Andheri, Juhu, Powai, and 30+ localities. We list verified flats, apartments, penthouses, and offices for sale and rent with real photos, carpet area details, and transparent pricing. Our search helps you find the right property faster.\n\n© 2026 Property Butler. All rights reserved.\n\nProperty Butler LLP · MahaRERA A061182600690 · Mumbai, India","images":[]},{"url":"https://houssed.com/mumbai/sambhav-group/sambhav-terraces-127354","title":"Sambhav Terraces, Malabar Hill, Mumbai | 3 BHK Ultra Luxury Apartments | Houssed","raw_content":"![Houssed](/assets/images/houssed_logo.svg)\n![whatsapp](/assets/images/whatsapp.svg)\n![Project Image of Sambhav Terraces in Malabar Hill, Mumbai - Image 268206](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/127354/Project%20Image/Hou-1749302639.webp)\n![Project Image of Sambhav Terraces in Malabar Hill, Mumbai - Image 268207](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/127354/Project%20Image/1-1749302639.webp)\n![Amenities of Sambhav Terraces in Malabar Hill, Mumbai - Image 268208](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/127354/Amenities/f863cfd00f7a7ae83069f4525663cc36-1749302650.webp)\n![Amenities of Sambhav Terraces in Malabar Hill, Mumbai - Image 268209](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/127354/Amenities/583_1678021233_487237fce9ad1a349427d8acddb98f79-1749302650.webp)\n![Location of Sambhav Terraces in Malabar Hill, Mumbai - Image 268212](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/127354/Location/Hou-1749302661.webp)\n\n## Project Overview of Sambhav Terraces Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\nProject Status\n\nNew Launch\n\nNo. of Units\n\n56 Units\n\nProject Area\n\n0.23 Acres\n\nOwnership\n\nFreehold\n\nTowers / Floors\n\n1 Towers  / 22 Floors\n\nProperty View\n\nOpen View\n\nParking\n\nTwo Wheeler, Four Wheeler\n\n## Floor Plans & Pricing of Sambhav Terraces Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n![2 BHK Flat in Sambhav Terraces in Malabar Hill, Mumbai - Image 851511](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/127354/BHK_Configuration/2-bhk-825-1749292762.webp)\n\nCarpet Area\n\n825 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n5.35 Cr\n\n![3 BHK Flat in Sambhav Terraces in Malabar Hill, Mumbai - Image 851536](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/127354/BHK_Configuration/3-bhk-1079-1749302518.webp)\n\nCarpet Area\n\n1079 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n7 Cr\n\n![3 BHK Flat in Sambhav Terraces in Malabar Hill, Mumbai - Image 851537](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/127354/BHK_Configuration/3-vbhk-1249-1749302551.webp)\n\nCarpet Area\n\n1249 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n8.1 Cr\n\n![5 BHK Flat in Sambhav Terraces in Malabar Hill, Mumbai - Image 851539](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/127354/BHK_Configuration/5-bhk-1997-1749302572.webp)\n\nCarpet Area\n\n1997 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n12.96 Cr\n\n![5 BHK Flat in Sambhav Terraces in Malabar Hill, Mumbai - Image 851541](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/127354/BHK_Configuration/5-bhk-2493-1749302589.webp)\n\nCarpet Area\n\n2493 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n16.18 Cr\n\n![Floor Plan of Sambhav Terraces in Malabar Hill, Mumbai - Image 268213](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/127354/Floor%20Plan/fp-1749302670.webp)\n\n## Key Features of Sambhav Terraces Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n## Amenities Sambhav Terraces Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n### Convenience\n\n### Safety\n\n### Sports\n\n### Leisure\n\n### Environment\n\n### Home Specifications\n\n## Google Map Location of Sambhav Terraces Malabar Hill\n\n## Locality Overview of Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n[Malabar Hill](/location-review/mumbai/malabar-hill-real-estate-guide) is a fast-developing residential area in Mumbai, preferred for its open surroundings and improving connectivity. The locality offers access to daily conveniences such as schools, healthcare facilities, and retail options within the broader Malabar Hill region.\n\nWith increasing residential development and infrastructure growth, Malabar Hill is often considered by buyers looking for affordable housing and long-term value.\n\n## RERA QR codes\n\nSambhav Terraces is a real estate project registered under Maharashtra Real Estate Regulatory Authority, ensuring transparency and accountability in its development. Scan the RERA QR code or search for the project here: <https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/>\n\n## Explore Neighbourhood Sambhav Terraces Malabar Hill\n\n### Restaurant\n\n### School\n\n### Hospital\n\n### Shopping\n\n![Sambhav Group](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Developer/FirmLogos/724_1678040177_sambhav-logo.webp)\n\n## [Sambhav Group](/mumbai/sale/builder/sambhav-group-724)\n\nOngoing Projects: 7\n\nCompleted Projects: 5\n\nTotal Projects: 12\n\n![blog image](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/ProductPage/2026/1/1-1749302639-1768040173.webp)\n\n## About Sambhav Terraces, Mumbai, Malabar Hill\n\n[Sambhav Terraces](https://houssed.com/mumbai/sambhav-group/sambhav-terraces-127354), Malabar Hill, is a location shaped by long-held homes, guarded privacy, and land values built over generations rather than sales cycles. It's a 22-storey residential tower that redefines luxury living in South Mumbai. The project offers thoughtfully designed 2 BHK, 3 BHK, and expansive 5 BHK residences, each designed with a strong focus on space, light, and everyday comfort.\n\n## 1. Why Do Ultra-Luxury Buyers Prefer Sambhav Terraces?\n\nMalabar Hill is one of Mumbai’s most stable residential zones. It has a limited land supply, strict development norms, and a resident profile that has remained consistent for decades. It has a limited land supply, strict development norms, and a resident profile that has remained consistent for decades.\n\nSambhav Terraces benefits from this reliability. The project is located within a low-density environment, surrounded by established residences, which keeps noise levels low, traffic manageable, and the overall living experience calm by Mumbai standards.\n\n## 2. The Neighbourhood & Surroundings\n\nMalabar Hill’s greatest luxury is its location. Marine Drive, Nariman Point, Charni Road, and Girgaon are all within a short driving distance. Daily travel remains predictable because the area does not attract sudden traffic or office crowds.\n\nWithin minutes, residents can access high-end cafes, fine-dining restaurants, boutique bars, exclusive clubs, and private social venues. This allows homeowners to enjoy quiet mornings and chaotic evenings without long commutes.\n\n### Connectivity and Travel\n\nClose access to Marine Drive, Walkeshwar Road, and Peddar Road\n\nSmooth connectivity to Nariman Point, Churchgate, Lower Parel, and BKC via arterial routes\n\nReasonable access to Western Express Highway through South Mumbai corridors\n\nEstablished road infrastructure with minimal disruption from large transit projects\n\nFor daily movement, residents rely more on short drives than long commutes. This reduces travel stress and supports a more predictable lifestyle.\n\n### Essential Services Nearby\n\nReputed schools and international curriculum institutions\n\nLeading hospitals such as Jaslok and Apollo hospital\n\nBanks, private clinics, and premium retail outlets\n\nDaily convenience stores, pharmacies, and home service providers\n\n## 3. Local Real Estate Market Performance\n\nLimited new supply due to land scarcity and strict approvals\n\nStable pricing with slow but consistent appreciation\n\nLow distress sales and minimal inventory overhang\n\nStrong resale value for quality developments\n\n## 3. Rapid Infrastructure Development\n\n### Micro-Local Happenings That Affect Property Value\n\nWhile Malabar Hill does not see large-scale infrastructure announcements, smaller civic upgrades play a quiet but important role.\n\nThese include:\n\nRoad resurfacing and traffic flow improvements\n\nBeautification of heritage zones and public spaces\n\nUtility upgrades for water supply and underground cabling\n\nImproved security and civic monitoring\n\n### Cafes, Fine Dining, and Social Lounges\n\nFine dining restaurants with legacy value\n\nQuiet cafes and bakeries\n\nPrivate clubs and social spaces\n\nProximity to Colaba and Fort\n\n### Lifestyle Amenities in and Around the Area\n\nSpas, wellness clinics, and personal trainers\n\nSelect pubs and lounges that focus on exclusivity\n\nPremium residential amenities such as private pools, fitness clubs, spas, and sauna rooms within newer developments\n\n## 4. Notable Landmarks\n\nHanging Gardens and Kamala Nehru Park\n\nWalkeshwar Temple and Banganga Tank\n\nBabulnath Temple\n\nMarine Drive and Girgaon Chowpatty\n\nNariman Point business district\n\nCharni Road and Churchgate railway stations\n\n## 5. The Builder Profile: Praman Developers\n\nPraman Developers has established a trust for quality and elegance in Mumbai’s luxury residential sector. With three ongoing projects and a focus on thoughtful design, the developer emphasizes skilled labor, timely delivery, and premium finishes. Their work reflects a dedication to creating homes that offer elegance and functionality, catering to discerning buyers who expect nothing less than excellence.\n\n## 6. Is Sambhav Terraces Worth Investing In?\n\nThe project appeals to a specific investment profile. It suits investors who value stability, brand protection, and long-term appreciation.\n\n### Rental Yield Potential\n\nKey tenant profiles include:\n\nSenior corporate leaders\n\nDiplomats and consulate-linked professionals\n\nBusiness families seeking long-term rentals\n\nExpats looking for quiet South Mumbai addresses\n\nWhile yields may not match commercial hotspots, vacancy risk remains low for well-maintained luxury units.\n\n### Long-Term Appreciation\n\nNear-zero land availability\n\nControlled redevelopment supply\n\nContinued preference for South Mumbai among HNIs\n\nStrong resale demand for branded luxury projects\n\nOver a long holding period, such assets tend to outperform volatile micro-markets.\n\n### Micro-Market Stability\n\nIt's less affected by:\n\nInfrastructure delays\n\nOversupply\n\nRental volatility\n\nSpeculative pricing\n\n### Demand Drivers Around the Area\n\nProximity to South Mumbai business districts\n\nEstablished social and civic infrastructure\n\nLimited luxury housing options\n\nPreference for low-density living\n\n## Final Thoughts\n\nSambhav Terraces caters to buyers and investors who are aware of South Mumbai’s old luxury rules. Location first & privacy always. For homebuyers, it offers a quiet, established neighborhood with modern comforts layered carefully on top. For investors, it provides a low-risk entry into one of Mumbai’s most defensible micro-markets.\n\n## FAQ's about Sambhav Terraces Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n# Sambhav Terraces Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\nBHK\n\n2,3,5 BHK\n\nCarpet Area\n\n820 - 2500 Sq Ft\n\nPossession\n\n30-Sep-2027\n\nProperty Type\n\nFlat\n\n₹ 5.3 Cr - 16.2 Cr\n\nRera No.\n\nP51900052101\n\nDeveloped By\n\nSambhav Group\n\n## Get in Touch with Houssed Associate\n\n![Find Homes by Drive Time](/assets/images/FindHomesByDriveTime.svg)\n\n## Popular Real Estate Searches\n\n### Browse Homes in Malabar Hill\n\n### Discover Homes in Malabar Hill\n\n### Explore Projects in Malabar Hill\n\n### Homes by BHK in Malabar Hill\n\n### Homes by Budget in Malabar Hill\n\n### Homes by View in Malabar Hill\n\n### Explore Nearby Localities\n\n![Houssed Logo](/assets/images/houssed_logo_white.svg)\n\nA Customer-First Real Estate Platform Powered by Trusted Agents, Built on Transparency.\n\n### Houssed\n\n### Search\n\n### Support\n\n![email](/assets/images/email.svg)\n\n### Download Agent App\n\n![Download on the App Store](/assets/images/iosstore.webp)\n![Get it on Google Play](/assets/images/playstore.webp)\n\nDisclaimer: The information on this platform, including property listings, project details, and pricing, is for general informational purposes only. While we strive for accuracy, we make no warranties about the completeness or reliability of any content. Users should independently verify all information before making any purchasing or investment decisions. This platform does not constitute an offer or recommendation to buy or sell property. We disclaim any liability for loss or damage arising from use of or reliance on this information. All trademarks, logos, and images belong to their respective owners and are used for identification purposes only.\n\n© 2026 Houssed Technologies Pvt Ltd. All rights reserved.","images":[]}],"failed_results":[],"response_time":1.02,"request_id":"43a9d152-e850-41c6-96b9-c4b4d4fe6714"}